*>================================================================
*> PROGRAM:  lob_market_maker.cbl
*> PURPOSE:  Automated Spread Quoting Engine with Inventory Skew
*> ================================================================
 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
 PROGRAM-ID. LOB-MARKET-MAKER.

 ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
 CONFIGURATION SECTION.
 SPECIAL-NAMES.
     DECIMAL-POINT IS COMMA.

 DATA DIVISION.
 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
 01  WS-SKEW-TOTAL          PIC S9(09)V9(04) COMP-3 VALUE 0.
 01  WS-ADJUSTED-MID        PIC S9(09)V9(04) COMP-3 VALUE 0.

 LINKAGE SECTION.
 COPY "MARKET-MAKER.cpy".

 PROCEDURE DIVISION USING MM-QUOTER-STATE.
 0000-MAIN.
     COMPUTE WS-SKEW-TOTAL = MM-INVENTORY-POSITION * MM-SKEW-PER-UNIT
     COMPUTE WS-ADJUSTED-MID = MM-BASE-MID-PRICE - WS-SKEW-TOTAL
     COMPUTE MM-BID-QUOTE-PRICE = WS-ADJUSTED-MID - MM-HALF-SPREAD-DELTA
     COMPUTE MM-ASK-QUOTE-PRICE = WS-ADJUSTED-MID + MM-HALF-SPREAD-DELTA
     GOBACK.
